  "instructions": [
    "1. Cut the fennel into 1-inch pieces.",
    "2. In a bowl, mix together the flour, cornstarch, salt, black pepper, garlic powder, and garam masala.",
    "3. Dip each fennel piece into the flour mixture, coating evenly.",
    "4. Heat the oil in a deep frying pan over medium-high heat.",
    "5. Fry the fennel pieces in batches until golden brown and crispy.",
    "6. Drain the fried fennel on paper towels.",
    "7. Mix the lemon juice with the fried fennel pieces.",
    "8. Serve hot and enjoy!"
